<PlainLayout title="Consent & Privacy Controls — Pilot Protocol — Pilot Protocol (plain)" description="Four features ship on by default in Pilot Protocol: telemetry, broadcasts, reviews, and skill injection. Risk profiles, benefits, and opt-out commands for each." canonical="https://pilotprotocol.network/plain/docs/consent/">

